{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d045384425c3f805","name":"Scatter Gun","source":{"id":"source:reference-d045384425c3f805","title":"Scatter Gun","revision":20940,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:50:46Z","sha256":"29f474ef9202d201d3ba7c54e1833eba03615fb27195029bf3b86981e9742f8a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20940","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Scatter%20Gun&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d045384425c3f805","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Found on primitive planets where slugthrowers are still used, the Scatter Gun is a large-barreled, low-velocity Slugthrower that launches a blast of pellets spreading out over a distance. Scatter Guns and their ammunition are cheap to manufacture and are primarily used for hunting. However, mercenaries, marines, and other soldiers sometimes carry a Scatter Gun as a backup weapon for facing enemies in close quarters or for clearing rooms in house-to-house fighting. Scatter Guns deal 3d8 points of damage at Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", 2d8 points of damage at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},", and no damage at Medium or Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Scatter Guns do not need ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Packs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Packs"},". Instead, they fire individual shells. Scatter Guns hold 10 shells that each cost 2 credits and weigh 0.1 kg.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 275\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8 (Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},"), 2d8 (Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 4 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," Scatter Guns cannot fire at targets at Medium or Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". \n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
